[L2]   "content": "# NOTEBOOKLM EXPORT REFRESH — Conversation Folders 18 + 19

**Date:** 2026-09-18  
**Authority:** Nathan-direct intake update  
**Status:** ACTIVE / immediate ingestion cue

Nathan reports that **new NotebookLM exports have now been added to conversation folders 18 and 19**.

## Immediate handling

Treat both folders as newly changed source surfaces. Do not assume earlier ingestion of folder 18 is complete, and do not treat folder 19 merely as a future watch target; it is now populated and should enter the active ingestion/indexing/provenance workflow.

Process incrementally and preserve source identity. Do not conflate:

- Nathan-direct conversation text;
- NotebookLM-generated summaries or syntheses;
- NotebookLM extractions/quoted source material;
- assistant-generated interpretation;
- underlying archive documents referenced by an export.

Where an NLM export appears to preserve or summarize a Nathan-direct methodological or theory formulation, recover the underlying source before assigning Nathan-direct authority where practical.

