\section{Relativistic-Quantum Isomorphism and Lattice Implementation}
\subsection{Lattice Implementation:  Minimization Algorithm}
To reproduce lattice QFT results:
\begin{enumerate}
    \item \textbf{Initialize Lattice:} Define nodes in the filament lattice with spacing $a \le \ell_f$ 
to prevent torsion aliasing.
